 avoid  having to explain key neon simply says  that she is the man's girlfriend just  then security guards arrive looking for  the stalker before running away she asks  kenian to take the front seat in the  architectural blocks lecture hall while  she is at it she slips a memory card  into keeneon's bag so that even if she  gets caught her hard work won't be  seized keaneon takes a seat in the said  lecture hall and is surprised when yon  shin walks in as the professor they lock  eyes and kenian waves at him but he  plays it cool and continues taking  attendance she notices a puzzle box on  the podium and finds out that every year  yonshin challenges his students to solve  the puzzle the one who solves it can ask  him for anything they want but yonshin  is sure that none of the freshmen can  solve a puzzle so advanced after the  class the girls take turns trying to  solve it but fail miserably a few  minutes later he walks into the hall to  notice that kenyan has already solved it  surprised he asks her to come to his  office she notices the memory card in  her bag and brings it out but yonshin  seizes it he connects it to his computer  to find out that it has nothing but  pictures of him keaney on swears that  the card isn't hers and her intentions  with him are pure but the comment  doesn't make yon shin feel better he  puts the topic aside and asks her how  she managed to solve the puzzle it turns  out that her father was also an  architect and had boxes like it laying  around the house all the time she used  to play with them as a child hence she  knows how they work she also explains an  elaborate way to solve it which  impresses yon shin as for her reward she  asks to be his teaching assistant so she  can be closer to him yanshin agrees but  claims that to keep her job she needs to  make him remember her name by the end of  the week or she will have to resign from  her post keeneon thinks the task should  be easy but little does she know that  yon shin doesn'